[quote="elias4444"]

&nbsp;it&#39;s frustrating for someone to die and no longer be involved for the rest of the game

[/quote]

&nbsp;

You know that incapacitated heroes get to use an incapacitated power on their turn, right?

&nbsp;

You&#39;re playing with three heroes. Though the game has the &#39;H&#39; scaling mechanic, it only goes so far. Most of the villains are considerably harder with only three heroes. Try having someone place two heroes so you can have four.

&nbsp;

Voss&#39; big gotcha is Forced Deployment. You may be able to play for the eventuality that it&#39;s coming.

&nbsp;

La Capitan is swingy. In some games she gets a ton of minions out. In others, not as many.

&nbsp;

Try this team against Voss: Legacy, Wraith, Ra, Tempest. If Wraith gets the Infrared eyepiece, use it to try to control Voss&#39; deck to bury Forced Deployment and the ships. Hopefully Legacy and Ra will be able to boost Tempest so that Tempests&#39; base power can kill all the minions.

&nbsp;

